{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB節目《Grand 住去首爾》最新預告曝光，主持周嘉洛及朱敏瀚終於同韓國天王金鍾國同框！兩人化身小粉絲，在 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB節目《Grand 住去首爾》最新預告曝光，主持周嘉洛及朱敏瀚終於同韓國天王金鍾國同框！兩人化身小粉絲，在健身房見到偶像時竟忍不住瘋狂喪摸對方肌肉，場面極度搞笑。金鍾國更即場展示超強腹肌，但畫面竟被打格，究竟發生咩事？\n</p>\n<h2>周嘉洛朱敏瀚Gym房朝聖 瘋狂喪摸金鍾國爆肌</h2>\n<p>在最新曝光的片段中，周嘉洛及朱敏瀚齊齊現身 gym room，準備與韓國頂流爆肌代表金鍾國大鬥「男子力」。當見到偶像真人時，兩位香港大隻仔代表即時表現得非常雀躍，與金鍾國打招呼時更忍不住「係咁摸係咁摸」，完全將粉絲心態表露無遺，場面相當搞笑。這次難得的機會，讓兩位主持興奮之情溢於言表，完全忘記了鏡頭的存在，與偶像的互動自然又有趣。</p>\n<h2>金鍾國展現實力者本色 邊做Gym邊飆高音腹肌竟被打格</h2>\n<p>出名是「能力者」兼唱功了得的金鍾國，在節目中亦毫不吝嗇，即席示範邊做 gym 邊氣定神閒大展歌喉的獨門絕技，讓在場的周嘉洛及朱敏瀚嘆為觀止。為了滿足觀眾，金鍾國更應要求大晒超強腹肌。不過，製作組在預告片中卻為「金腹肌」打上厚格，吊足觀眾胃口，令一眾粉絲心癢難耐，想一睹金鍾國真正的「腹肌實力」，就要密切留意節目正式播出。\n</p>\n<h2>網民熱話「金城安遇上Gym鍾國」 半日吸逾7,500 Likes</h2>\n<p>金鍾國與「金城安」周嘉洛的歷史性同框，隨即引爆網民熱烈討論，有網民更以「金城安遇上 Gym 鍾國」為題分享消息，帖文在短短半日內已狂吸超過 7,500 個 Likes，可見期待值極高！網民紛紛留言洗版：「初初仲以為剪接/AI」、「我連節目名都未知就已經好想睇」、「還我遮咗嘅腹肌」、「呢個聯動勁有趣」、「我老公（周嘉洛）同金鍾國做 gym」、「會唔會有 Running Man Grand 住番外篇」、「能力者！」、「香港大隻仔 S VS 韓國大隻仔」、「竟然係真」、「OMG OMG OMG」。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_10719975536ae17b1b8a423.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"grand住去首爾 金鍾國 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_10719975536ae17b1b8a423.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_6458924256ae17b1f0ad5c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"grand住去首爾 金鍾國 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_6458924256ae17b1f0ad5c.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/05_20604282716ae17b119aacd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"grand住去首爾 金鍾國 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/05_20604282716ae17b119aacd.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06_14519907666ae17b15301ff.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"grand住去首爾 金鍾國 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06_14519907666ae17b15301ff.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/07_9681691356ae17b1880b0a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"grand住去首爾 金鍾國 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/07_9681691356ae17b1880b0a.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_16957288186ae17b3c5e73a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"grand住去首爾 金鍾國 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_16957288186ae17b3c5e73a.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_20793380366ae17b439c9e9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"grand住去首爾 金鍾國 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_20793380366ae17b439c9e9.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19_13928562046ae17b476621f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"grand住去首爾 金鍾國 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19_13928562046ae17b476621f.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20_16373899806ae17b4b57a02.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"grand住去首爾 金鍾國 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20_16373899806ae17b4b57a02.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/grand%e4%bd%8f%e5%8e%bb%e9%a6%96%e7%88%be/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Grand住去首爾</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb%e5%8d%b3%e6%99%82%e8%b3%87%e8%a8%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tvb即時資訊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%91%a8%e5%98%89%e6%b4%9b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">周嘉洛</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%87%91%e9%8d%be%e5%9c%8b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">金鍾國</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3531406\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 28 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:43:02.422904+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1261,"images":9,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T05:20:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T07:38:45.690082+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:38:45.690082+00:00","content_hash":"f37b7be56153ae74e266a0168afc29d60